      "writtenOn": "2023-09-20T15:21:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, for `ResourceProvider::deleteBackendTexture` we invalidate the BackendTexture by reassigning it to a new/blank one, prohibiting us from declaring it as const. Should I keep this as-is or explore a different way to invalidate the BackendTexture?",
      "parentUuid": "f743831d_d6195252",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 154,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 154,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "876a2ba707bf5b997f94f2086e2e898d3b8e47df",
